{
  "bookId": "rewind-56",
  "id": "chapter-230",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43206001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "连日的搜寻一直毫无收获，没想到今天就碰到一个大的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "这么漂亮的光泽……这东西究竟是不是金子做的啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "唔，有了，我来咬一口就知道了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "菈冬抱起卡牌，狠狠地用力咬了一口。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "嘶……够硬啊。不过味道还是不对，肯定不是金子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "半小时后——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "哎，还以为可以直接融化掉打成金币，果然没这么便宜的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "嗯？卡牌背面印有「FULI限定」的字样……唔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "或许我能拿去转卖，前提是要能卖个好价钱。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "啊，好麻烦。不是真的金子，我也说不好这玩意值多少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "但不试试，怎么会知道呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "黑市那种地方总有眼光独到的家伙——比如那个S-VIII。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43206013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "行了，说干就干，这就到黑市碰碰运气。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1137",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "ladon",
          "rowIds": [
            43206001,
            43206002,
            43206003,
            43206004,
            43206005,
            43206006,
            43206007,
